          <change when="2023-10-24T06:59:02-04:00" who="http://papyri.info/editor/users/Fran%C3%A7ois%20Gerardin">Submit - I have entered the correction of BL 2.2.186 l. 28. &#xD;
The scribe wrote Ναυκρατεῖται l. 21-22 and βουλευτὴς l. 26-27 with additional letters, as noted by Wilcken in W. Chr. 27. The person who previously entered the text was misled by Wilcken's pre-Leiden system way of transcribing this and understood it to be scribal corrections. In accordance with Wilcken's reading and transcription, I have put these interpolations into braces instead.</change>
